---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | EinfachFabi">
	<section class="reading">
		<header class="article-header">
			<p class="eyebrow">Information</p>
			<h1>About Me</h1>
		</header>

		<div class="article-body">
			<p>
				Hi, I’m Fabian. I work in IT and have a strong passion for technology, Linux, and tinkering with systems.
			</p>
			<p>
				In my free time, I enjoy going for walks, exploring new places, and capturing the best moments along the way with my camera. This site is my personal space to share both sides: practical tech notes and guides on one hand, and visual impressions from my walks and trips on the other.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
